{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021104957531-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021105623\"/><p>事主送往北大嶼山醫院。</p><p>東涌有人墮樓。今晨(21日)6時45分，富東邨東埔樓一名男子，倒臥在上址一花槽，由保安員發現報案。救援人員接報到場，將昏迷姓何(53歲)男子送往北大嶼山醫院治理，其後證實死亡。經初步調查，相信事主從上址一單位墮下。警員於現場有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:39:40.382483+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:49:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:52.398736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:52.398736+00:00","content_hash":"195b1b9e6e6f4ee89f0cbb25f183c3ea6e1acbfc6a6ce4fd792901dcc62d4141","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}